    <h1>Bruno Hebling Vieira</h1>
    <div class="ornament" aria-hidden="true"><span>&sect;</span></div>
    <p class="titlepage__lead">
      Postdoctoral researcher at the
      <a href="https://www.psychology.uzh.ch/en/areas/nec/plafor/">Methods of Plasticity Research</a>
      group, University of Zurich. I study how to describe, understand and predict brain
      dynamics <em>in vivo</em> &mdash; and how modern machine learning can be made to
      say something trustworthy about individual brains.
    </p>
